msgid "Additional command line options"
msgstr "Komando-lerroko aukera gehigarriak"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1151
msgid ""
"Options VLC reads at every start, as if they were written on its command "
"line (the command line wins when it gives the same option). Write them as on "
"a command line, for example: --no-osd --network-caching=3000; quote a value "
"with spaces. Files to open, and the options only a command line can give (--"
"help, --config, --reset-config...), are left out."
msgstr ""
"VLCk abiarazten den bakoitzean irakurtzen dituen aukerak, komando-lerroan "
"idatzita baleude bezala (aukera bera ematen duenean, komando-lerroak du "
"lehentasuna). Idatzi komando-lerro batean bezala, adibidez: --no-osd --"
"network-caching=3000; jarri komatxo artean zuriuneak dituen balio bat. Ireki "
"beharreko fitxategiak eta komando-lerroak soilik eman ditzakeen aukerak (--"
"help, --config, --reset-config...) kanpoan geratzen dira."

